WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:05.100
As much as he might like to be, the Merc with
a Mouth simply isn't one of Earth's Mightiest

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.100
Heroes.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.280
"Pump the hate brakes, Thanos."

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.740
Deadpool star Ryan Reynolds sent a congratulatory
note to the Avengers: Infinity War cast over

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:17.350
the weekend as a way to applaud their accomplishments
and the film's record-breaking opening weekend.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.500
But Ryan Reynolds being Ryan Reynolds, there
was a bit of snark in the post.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.070
Reynolds posted a letter of dismissal from
the one and only Iron Man, which showed that

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.589
not only did the "genius billionaire playboy
philanthropist" reject Deadpool's plea to

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:34.150
join the team, but he was pretty mean about
it, too, writing: "No.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.260
Absolutely not.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.540
Go bother Professor X.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.540
No."

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.540
"So dark.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.320
Are you sure you're not from the DC Universe?"

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:44.330
While Tony might've come off angrier than
the Hulk in that note, Deadpool clearly isn't

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.240
holding a grudge because Reynolds said he
was glad that the Avengers never quit doing

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.240
what they do.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.030
Chances are, Deadpool isn't the only one who'd
love to see himself link up with the super

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:57.920
hero squad, but he's been limited to living
in 20th Century Fox's extended X-Men movie

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.500
universe as a result of licensing issues that
sent Marvel's characters in separate directions.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:07.780
However, with Disney's recent $52.4 billion
merger with Fox, which sees the House of Mouse

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:11.760
acquire most of the company's assets, that
might change a few years into the future.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.250
"We're gonna form a super duper f---ing group."

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:18.580
For now, Marvel lovers can revel in the massive
madness of Avengers: Infinity War, out in

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:22.250
theaters now, before Deadpool 2 opens wide
on May 18.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.250
Thanks for watching!

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.409
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:01:25.409 --> 00:01:27.460
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

